pdate v2.2 is now available for VRIT ! \ud83d\udcaa\n\nHere are the patch notes :\n\n- The game now targets 90fps instead of 80fps and uses Vulkan for rendering instead of OpenGLES3\n- There are now bubbles that will appear at regular intervals in SpeedRUN mode (in a predictable and fair manner, of course). Popping them will deduct 2 seconds from your time. \u23f1\ufe0f\n- Improved the bullets charging mechanic during Run phases. Your hands now get all shiny when fully charged ! \u2728\n- You can now destroy the \"big bad bullets\" from those big robots by shooting 10 bullets at them.\n- The exercise instructions will appear slowly only when you come across them for the first time.", "created_date": 1689963607, "id": "6731341180217686", "version": "2.2", "version_code": 36, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3894534127231753", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "8638869799464805"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "710309429649470"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1689953983, "id": "6730920406926430", "version": "2.2", "version_code": 35, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3894534127231753", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "8638869799464805"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "710309429649470"}]}, "change_log": "Update 2.1 is now available for VRIT \ud83d\udcaa\nHere are the patch notes :\n\n- Added a warning on the startup screen if hand tracking is disabled\n- Improved the slider buttons\n- Improved the Crossbody Toe Touch animation during warmup\n- Reworked the \"shoot\" animation in the Run rules\n- Added a mention of the \"hand closed\" gesture in the Run rules\n- Improved the stretching music mix", "created_date": 1681399991, "id": "6384735771544897", "version": "2.1", "version_code": 34, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}